SUMMARY:R-Ladies+ Melbourne End of Year trivia event & 10th Birthday! - R-Ladies+ Melbourne
DESCRIPTION:🎉 **R-Ladies+ Melbourne is turning 10!** 💜🎂\nAnd what better way to celebrate a decade of R, data science, and community than with an R-themed Trivia Night!\n\nJoin us for a fun evening of trivia, laughs, and a little friendly competition as we put our R knowledge to the test!\n\nThere will be prizes!!\n\nFrom R basics and quirky coding questions to packages and data visualisation, there'll be something for everyone - whether you're an R newbie or a seasoned tidyverse enthusiast!\n\n✨ No coding required, just bring your curiosity and competitive spirit!\nMost importantly, it's a chance to celebrate 10 years of R-Ladies+ Melbourne and celebrate the end of the year, reconnect with familiar faces, and welcome new members to our community.\n\nFood and drinks will be provided!\n\n💜 Everyone is welcome to our celebration!
LOCATION:DiUS, level 3/31 Queen St, Melbourne VIC 3000, Australia, Melbourne, AUSTRALIA
URL:https://www.meetup.com/rladies-melbourne/events/317281096/
ORGANIZER;CN=R-Ladies+ Melbourne:mailto:info@rladies.org
CATEGORIES:RLadies+,R-Ladies+ Melbourne
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENTBEGIN:VEVENT
